// Note [AMX attention dispatch]). Evaluated by the dispatch, the save_k
// write-through and the mirror-arena allocation; the page-move and
// fill_random rebuilds do not test it - they rebuild whatever plane exists.
// So for a book the scheduler creates (an arena only when the plugin passes
// this gate) the reader and the writers agree on which models take the AMX
// path; a book built with amx_mirror_eligible=true by hand gets planes for
// every slot, gate or no gate.

